  "howToPlayCoreTitle": "Core Objective",
  "howToPlayCoreDesc": "Your goal is to clear the entire puzzle grid by guiding every arrow off the board. When no arrows remain on the board, the level is complete.",
  "howToPlayMovementTitle": "Arrow Movement",
  "howToPlayMovementDesc": "Tap any arrow to launch it. Arrows slide forward in the exact direction their arrowhead points: Up, Down, Left, or Right. Even if an arrow has a bent or winding body, it always exits following its tip.",
  "howToPlayObstaclesTitle": "Obstacles & Collisions",
  "howToPlayObstaclesDesc": "An arrow can only escape if its entire exit path is completely clear. If another arrow stands in the way, the tapped arrow will shake and stay in place.",
  "howToPlayLivesTitle": "Lives & Health",
  "howToPlayLivesDesc": "In Classic mode, you start with 3 hearts. Tapping a blocked arrow costs 1 heart. If you deplete all 3 hearts, you must restart the level. You can toggle Infinite Lives in Settings anytime.",
  "howToPlayTurnDotsTitle": "Turn Dots (Redirectors)",
  "howToPlayTurnDotsDesc": "Look for circular dots on empty grid cells marked with small arrows. When a sliding arrow crosses a Turn Dot, it instantly pivots in the dot's direction and consumes it, opening unexpected exit routes.",
  "howToPlayCombosTitle": "Combos & Streaks",
  "howToPlayCombosDesc": "Release arrows in quick succession (within 1.5 seconds) to trigger combos. Chaining consecutive escapes builds momentum and scores combo multipliers.",
  "howToPlayClassicTitle": "Classic Mode",
  "howToPlayClassicDesc": "The standard campaign progression. Advance through handcrafted and procedural stages of escalating size, shape masks, and path complexity with 3 hearts.",
  "howToPlayZenTitle": "Zen Mode",
  "howToPlayZenDesc": "Pure relaxation with zero stress. No hearts to lose, no time limits, and no failure states. Ideal for unwinding and practicing complex boards.",
  "howToPlayTimeAttackTitle": "Time Attack",
  "howToPlayTimeAttackDesc": "Fast-paced race against the clock! Every arrow you successfully escape awards precious bonus seconds back onto your countdown timer.",
  "howToPlayMultiplayerTitle": "Multiplayer Rooms",
  "howToPlayMultiplayerDesc": "Host or join with room seed codes. Both players compete on the exact same randomized layout to see who can solve and escape the board fastest.",
  "howToPlayRandomTitle": "Random Puzzles",
  "howToPlayRandomDesc": "Generate infinite on-demand puzzles across Easy, Medium, Hard, Master, and Expert difficulties without affecting your campaign level progress.",
  "howToPlayUnpeelTitle": "Unpeel From the Perimeter",
  "howToPlayUnpeelDesc": "Start by scanning the outer borders. Arrows pointing straight outward into empty space can always escape immediately, freeing up critical lanes.",
  "howToPlayTraceTitle": "Trace Blockers in Reverse",
  "howToPlayTraceDesc": "When an arrow is blocked, find which arrow blocks it, then find what blocks that second arrow. Unlocking the final blocker in the chain frees everything behind it.",
  "howToPlayTapAssistTitle": "Enable Tap Assist",
  "howToPlayTapAssistDesc": "If you play on smaller screens or tend to tap between tight arrow segments, turn on Tap Assist in Settings to automatically map nearby taps to the nearest arrow.",

